<title>GERMANY: Adidas says Q1 net profit up 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Adidas says Q1 net profit up 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   169     vs 127</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   219     vs 156</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,713   vs 1,197</p>
<p>Group profit before taxes and</p>
<p>    minority interests			 243     vs 171</p>
<p>    Group net profit per ord share	 3.72 dmk vs 2.80 dmk</p>
<p>    Group licence and commission income  22	vs 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sportswear manufacturer is Adidas AG.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
